      "meaning": "Whether the centre's stock at 4:00 PM Thursday (after Wednesday and Thursday collections) is at least 150 units. After Tuesday dispatch, centre stock is 220 - 150 = 70 units. Wednesday collection (8 hours) adds 96 units (total 166). Thursday collection before 4:00 PM (7 hours) adds 84 units (total 250). So enough, but again unstated usage could change."
    },
    {
      "about": "state:centre_has_enough_stock_tuesday",
      "meaning": "Whether the centre's stock at 4:00 PM Tuesday (after Monday and Tuesday collections) is at least 150 units to dispatch the Tuesday shipment. The centre starts with 40 units, collects 12 units/hour for 8 hours on Monday (96 units) and 7 hours on Tuesday (84 units) before 4:00 PM, totalling 220 units, which is enough. However, any unstated usage or losses could reduce stock."
    },
